 "text": "Patron Access - Kanza Coop\nMain\nUtilities\nAbout\nWhat is a Coop?\nNews\nBoard of Directors\nEmployee Directory\nOur Locations\nServices\nGrain\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nIuka Feeds\nSunflower Trading\nC-Stores\nFarm Supply Stores\nResources\nPatron Access\nKanza Connect\nKanza Club Card\nCareers\nCurrent Opportunities\nApply Now\nLinkedin\nInstagram\nFacebook\nContact Us\nPatron Access\nPatron Access\nCurrent Login\nKanza Coop (Current) >>\nPlease Note\nIn January of 2020, we moved to a new software system. Similar to our past system, customers can login to their account and to view, print and pay their accounts online, check contract balances, monitor prepaid balances and print volume statements, grain ledgers and invoices. Monitor your equity and grain balances, ask questions, or submit information requests 24 hours a day, 7 days a week .\nWant online access to your account?\nIf you haven’t request a new user name and password since January of 2020, please sending an email to AR@kanzacoop.com requesting access to our new system.\nPatron Access Sign-up\nUse this form to request account access to Patron Access. Account Name and Number can be located on your most recent invoice.\n*Name on Account:\n*Account Number:\n*Email:\n*Phone:\nName of requestor if different from name on account:\n*Security Code:\nQuestions?\nIf you have questions about online patron access, please contact Monica Lubbers\n(620) 352-9844 Ext 317\n2019 or Earlier\nDecommissioned Patron Access\nPlease note: To access account information from 2019 or earlier you will need to follow the correct link below and use your old user name and password.\nKanza Coop (History Only 2019 & Earlier >>\nAndale Coop (History Only) >>\n200 North Main\nIuka, KS 67066\nToll-free: (800) 536-5614\nABOUT\nWhat is a Coop?\nNews\nBoard of Directors\nEmployee Directory\nOur Locations\nSERVICES\nGrain\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nIuka Feeds\nSunflower Trading\nRESOURCES\nPatron Access\nKanza Connect\nKanza Club Card\nCAREERS\nOpenings\nApply Now\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n|\nSite Map\n© 2026 Kanza Coop - All rights reserved\nSearch for:\nMinimum 3 character allowed.",
